TITLE Transport exchange conductance problem

SOLUTION 0-10
    pH 7.0
    Ca 1.0
    Cl 2.0
END

SOLUTION 11
    pH 7.0
    Na 1.0
    Cl 1.0
END

EXCHANGE 1-10
    X- 0.001
END

USE solution 0
USE exchange 1

TRANSPORT
    -cells 10
    -shifts 10
    -boundary_conditions flux flux
    -flow_direction forward
    -print_cells 8
    -print_frequency 1
END
